    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O'Farrell Property is delighted to present this exceptional opportunity to acquire a residential and commercial property set on a generous c. 1-acre site, conveniently located just off the N80 at Ballykeenan.\r\n\r\nThe residential property extends to approximately 128 sq.m. and comprises an entrance hallway, kitchen/dining room, utility room, living room, four bedrooms, a family bathroom and an en-suite. Built circa 1926, the house offers excellent potential for refurbishment and modernisation, allowing the new owner to create a home tailored to their own style and requirements. Services include mains water, three phase electricity, a septic tank and oil-fired central heating.\r\n\r\nThe commercial element of the property comprises two units extending to approximately 500 sq.m. in total. Accessed via a separate, spacious entrance, the units open onto a substantial yard area, with the overall site extending to approximately 1 acre, providing excellent space for a wide range of commercial or storage uses.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned just one minute from the N80, the property benefits from excellent connectivity and a superb road network, making it an attractive option for both residential and business use.\r\n\r\nThis versatile property offers a wealth of possibilities, whether you're seeking to live and work from the same location, establish or expand a business with on-site accommodation, convert the residence into office space (subject to any necessary planning permissions), or generate rental income from the house while operating a business from the commercial units.\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure a property offering outstanding flexibility, generous space and an excellent location."
      },
